 "bodyHtml": "<a class=\"wd-skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<h1 id=\"project-estimate\">Project estimate</h1>\n<p>Move the sliders. The table recalculates. Trust this document to turn the sliders on.</p>\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"hours\":20}</script><input type=\"range\" data-wd-bind-input=\"hours\" min=\"1\" max=\"200\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\" aria-label=\"Hours\">\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"rate\":120}</script><input type=\"range\" data-wd-bind-input=\"rate\" min=\"50\" max=\"300\" step=\"10\" value=\"120\" aria-label=\"Rate\">\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"discount\":10}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"subtotal\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;*&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;hours&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;rate&quot;]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"subtotal\":2400}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"saved\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;/&quot;,[&quot;*&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;subtotal&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;discount&quot;]],[&quot;L&quot;,100]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"saved\":240}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"total\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;subtotal&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;saved&quot;]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"total\":2160}</script>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Amount</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Hours</td>\n<td><span data-wd-bind=\"hours\">20</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rate</td>\n<td><span data-wd-bind=\"rate\">120</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtotal</td>\n<td><span data-wd-bind=\"subtotal\">2400</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discount</td>\n<td><span data-wd-bind=\"saved\">240</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\n<td><strong><span data-wd-bind=\"total\">2160</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Slider positions are temporary preview state. They are not saved into the file.</p>\n\n</main>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/__wd/runtime.js\"></script>",
